+    (and therefore accepts ``norm_weight`` / ``w_preshuffle_bf16`` /
+    ``res_preshuffle``). Callers holding HIP-layout state use it to choose
+    between ``mhc_post_pre`` and ``aiter.mhc_fused_post_pre``."""
